{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"PROGRESS (session handoff):\n\nROOT-CAUSE CORRECTION: there is NO committed uv.lock in this repo — deps resolve fresh from pyproject on every make install/worktree. A FRESH worktree resolves the WORKING pair (pydantic-ai-slim 1.107.1 + anthropic 0.120.2). The break was in a STALE main .venv that had drifted to pydantic-ai-slim 1.38.0 + anthropic 0.120.2 (incremental upgrades pulled anthropic past what old pydantic-ai-slim supports). Import break: pydantic_ai.models.anthropic expects UserLocation from anthropic.types.beta.beta_web_search_tool_20250305_param, but newer anthropic renamed it BetaUserLocationParam -> AnthropicModel import fails.\n\nFIX APPLIED (worktree ../pin-anthropic-versions, branched from origin/main): pyproject.toml [agents] extra line changed\n  'pydantic-ai-slim[anthropic,retries]>=1,<2'\n  -> 'pydantic-ai-slim[anthropic,retries]>=1.107,<1.108' + added 'anthropic>=0.120,<0.121' (patch releases within each line still allowed). Added an explanatory comment. Bedrock (lines ~129/235) and openai (~230) extras LEFT UNTOUCHED — resolver unifies pydantic-ai-slim across extras, and origin/main stays on the direct Anthropic API config (not Bedrock/multi-provider) per maintainer instruction.\n\nCLAIM: claimed with --force because at claim time the local plan-review was INDETERMINATE ONLY due to a missing ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the non-interactive shell (deterministic floor PASSED, only advisory P6). NOTE: the key IS available in ~/.zshrc; a non-interactive bash shell must load it first:\n  eval \"$(grep -E '^[[:space:]]*export[[:space:]]+ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=' ~/.zshrc | tail -1)\"\n\nREMAINING: reinstall into worktree venv + verify AnthropicModel imports; make lint && make typecheck; commit with 'rebar-ticket: ce5d-d352-9511-47bc' trailer + DCO -s + Change-Id (commit-msg hook installed by make worktree); git push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main; land at LLM-Review +1 & Verified +1; ff worktree; transition closed."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785694772435873001,"uuid":"344fadd4-ee84-4b7a-8ae8-05fc1dc58fa6"}